@startuml cgms_sensor_if
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title CGMS Sensor Interface

component "Enzyme Electrode" as Electrode
component "Analog Front End (AFE)" as AFE
component "ADC" as ADC
component "MCU" as MCU

Electrode --> AFE : glucose current (nA)
AFE --> ADC : conditioned voltage
ADC --> MCU : digital samples

note right of AFE
AFE Functions:
- Transimpedance amplifier
- Noise filtering
- Gain calibration
end note

note right of MCU
Sampling Interval:
1–5 minutes
end note

@enduml
